flowchart LR
  Message[Message/task] --> Scope[Client scope lock]
  Scope --> Brief[Exact DesignBrief]
  DNA[Client DNA] --> Brief
  Brief --> Retrieve[Filtered hybrid retrieval]
  Retrieve --> Context[Context Pack]
  Context --> Plan[DesignPlan]
  Plan --> Reference[Private art-direction reference]
  Reference --> Assets[Shipping assets without required text]
  Plan --> Source[Editable .hyc source]
  Assets --> Source
  Source --> Manifest[Neutral semantic manifest]
  Source --> Render[Preview/exports]
  Brief --> QA[Hard QA]
  DNA --> QA
  Manifest --> QA
  Render --> QA
  QA --> Approval[Approval: source + QC hash]
  Approval --> Package[Source package]
  Package --> Drive[Drive]
  Approval --> Feedback[Structured feedback]
  Feedback --> DNA
